  'guides.user.first-chat.sub': 'Ask your AI Agent a question on the chat screen.',
  'guides.user.first-chat.what': 'An AI Agent is an AI assistant that helps with your work. Ask a question or hand over a task in the chat screen, and the AI Agent answers or uses its connected tools and skills to find information and do the work. An AI Agent\'s settings (personality, skills, tools and so on) live in the {v_profiles} screen, and that set of settings is called a profile.',
