  'guides.user.my-agents.when': 'Use it when an AI Agent does not answer and you want to check its status, or when you want another AI Agent Workspace for a different job (for example, reports). If the status stays at Preparing or Creating for a long time, tell an administrator. There is a limit on how many AI Agent Workspaces you can create.',
  'guides.user.my-agents.list.title': 'See your AI Agent Workspaces',
  'guides.user.my-agents.list.body': 'The "{g_agent} › {v_agents}" screen lists your AI Agent Workspaces and their status. Your limit is shown under the title.',
  'guides.user.my-agents.create.title': 'Create an AI Agent Workspace',
  'guides.user.my-agents.create.body': 'Click the + button next to the title (Create AI Agent Workspace) and enter a name. The AI Agent Workspace shows "Preparing" for a while and is ready to use after that. You change the personality, skills and secrets of its profiles on the "{v_profiles}" screen.',

  'guides.user.import-profile.title': 'Import a profile from elsewhere',
  'guides.user.import-profile.sub': 'Bring in the Hermes from your PC or a profile from another of your AI Agent Workspaces.',
  'guides.user.import-profile.what': 'Put the Hermes you used on your PC into one of your profiles, or create a new profile from a profile in another of your AI Agent Workspaces. An import from your PC replaces the personality, memories, skills, scheduled jobs and chat history of that profile with those from your PC. An import from another AI Agent Workspace copies only the personality (SOUL) and safe settings.',
  'guides.user.import-profile.when': 'Use it when you want to continue in AAS with the Hermes you used on your PC, or when you want to use a personality from another AI Agent Workspace in a new profile. The Import from PC button appears in the profile detail of your AI Agent Workspace (except the root profile default), for the owner of the AI Agent Workspace or an admin. It is not in the single-computer test install (Docker compose).',
  'guides.user.import-profile.pc-open.title': 'Click {pcImport}',
  'guides.user.import-profile.pc-open.body': 'Open the detail panel on the right for the profile to import into. At the top of the panel, before the close button, click the upload icon ("{pcImport}"). The import replaces the personality, memories, skills, scheduled jobs and chat history of that profile. Only the owner of the AI Agent Workspace and administrators see this button.',
  'guides.user.import-profile.pc-upload.title': 'Export on your PC and upload',
  'guides.user.import-profile.pc-upload.body':
    'Choose the operating system of your PC and run the export command shown in a terminal on your PC (PowerShell on Windows). In "{pcProfile}", enter the name of the profile you used on your PC (default is filled in for the main profile, and the profile name for other profiles). Drag the .tar.gz file into the drop area, or upload it with "{pcPick}". When the upload ends, the review step opens.',
  'guides.user.import-profile.pc-replace.title': 'Review and replace the profile',
