    'Check the Replaced and Kept lists and click "{pcReplace}". The secrets, MCP sign-ins, channel connections and model settings in AAS stay as they are, and those on your PC are not imported. Scheduled jobs are imported as paused. On the result screen, follow the things left to do: set the secrets and sign in to the MCP servers again.',
  'guides.user.import-profile.agent-open.title': 'Open {newProfile}',
  'guides.user.import-profile.agent-open.body': 'On the "{g_agent} › {v_profiles}" screen, click the + button next to the title ({newProfile}).',
