  'guides.user.change-soul.edit.title': 'Edit and save',
  'guides.user.change-soul.edit.body': 'Click Edit (Write if the text is empty), change the text and save. The new text applies from the next conversation. If you switch tabs or close the detail panel before saving, you are asked whether to discard your changes. If you go to another screen, your draft is kept, and you can continue with Continue editing when you open it again.',

