  'guides.user.secret.what': 'Secrets are API keys, tokens and passwords the AI Agent uses to sign in to outside services. Once saved, a value is never shown on screen again, and only the AI Agent uses it.',
  'guides.user.secret.when': 'Use it when a skill or MCP server asks for a key, or when a key expires or changes and you need to enter a new value.',
  'guides.user.secret.open.title': 'Open the {p_env} tab',
  'guides.user.secret.open.body': 'Open the "{p_env}" tab of your main profile. Existing values show only their name and "Set".',
  'guides.user.secret.add.title': 'Add a new secret',
  'guides.user.secret.add.body': 'In the Add new section, type a name, click Add secret, enter the value and save. Names start with a letter and use capital letters, digits and _ (for example, MY_API_KEY). Lowercase letters are changed to capitals. If you see an "unencrypted address" warning, the input is hidden on this address, so tell an administrator.',

