  'guides.user.messenger.allow.body': 'Turn on the messenger you want. If you leave the allowed users field empty and message the bot first, a request appears under Pairing requests and allowed users. Approving that request is the easiest way. To enter it yourself, use your user ID in the messenger app (not your AAS ID).',
