  'guides.user.cron.sub': 'Hand the same daily or weekly task to your AI Agent automatically.',
  'guides.user.cron.what': 'A scheduled job (cron) runs the same task for the AI Agent automatically at set times. You receive the result where you choose (for example, a messenger).',
  'guides.user.cron.when': 'Use it for repeated work such as a morning summary or a weekly report draft, so you do not have to ask every time.',
  'guides.user.cron.open.title': 'Open the {p_cron} tab',
  'guides.user.cron.open.body': 'See this AI Agent\'s scheduled jobs on the "{p_cron}" tab of your main profile.',
